Subject: [PATCH 162/196] Fix testnet minerfund addresses (#254)

When removing the random selection of addresses, there was a copy
and paste error which changed the miner fund addresses for the genesis
testnet fork. This commit changes those addresses back so that the
testnet blocks validate from a brand new resync.
